 "notes": [
  "Kit2 read (lane kit-batch-8504-20261121). Fronts on Laanweg: walls[0] the north-west front of the long wing (surface 1, 0-5.8 m) from w01-331s1/s2 (2025-06-30) and s3 (2024-10-21), walls[2] the west wing front (surface 4) from w03-293s2 (2025-06-30), same design. Each house is two 2.7 m bays: the ground row is red-brown brick with the front door bay (a white storage door beside a blue front door with a round light) and a window bay; the first floor grey-beige brick with one white two-light window per bay (groundFactor 0.8: the ground storey is about 2.7 m, the first floor about 3.4 m in the crops).",
  "walls[1] and walls[3]: the set-back top storey (surfaces 10 and 7, 5.7-8.6 m), per house a small white two-light window and a blue square panel with a round light (bayWindows; the blue panel as a door leaf in the blue door colour). Partly hidden behind the front's roof edge in the crops, foliage 31 %: read from w01-331s1/s3.",
  "walls[4] the back of the long wing (surface 8) from w02-151s3 (2024-10-21, 27.5 m of 82 m seen, hedges and sheds in front): red-brown ground, beige first floor, the top storey behind a continuous gallery balcony with white bar rails (balconyBands storey 2).",
  "Colours white-balanced on the white storage doors (true white assumed): the 2025-06-30 crops are exposed for the sky (wall raw #51574e, door raw #5e6c6d), the overcast 2024-10-21 crop w01-331s3 has a cool cast (white door raw #bcdde7); both give the same light grey-beige brick (#b8ab98 used, from s3), red-brown ground #6a5650, top storey #a39888, doors #31689a. Listed in measured.groups so the look draws them as sampled.",
  "No photo: the back of the west wing (surface 5, bearing 113) and both end walls (surfaces 2/3, 6/9): otherWalls window-grid. Not modelled: the glazed stair-hall bay with letterboxes at the north-east end of the front (w01-331s3), awnings, the black roller shutters."
 ]
